  "profileEditSnsPostsBlueskyConsentMessage": "RASQ's server reads {account}'s posts from Bluesky's public API and makes them **viewable by anyone on your RASQ account page**.\n\n• Bluesky posts are readable by anyone to begin with. Replies and reposts aren't imported.\n• **Your login key (app password / session) isn't deposited.** Only this account's DID and handle are sent to the server.\n• Only accounts whose ownership has been verified can use this (so no one can show someone else's posts).\n• Turning this switch off deletes the fetched posts immediately.",
