  "storeCatalogMisskeyDescription": "A Rust wasm plugin from rasq-sdk-sample. It implements contracts such as sns.login / sns.timeline / post.transform / tl.sort (PROTOCOL.md) and renders the timeline with RRL tiles. Post transforms without a node definition are applied right before posts are passed to the fetch node.",
