  "storeCatalogThemeStarryDescription": "Theme (`kind: \"theme\"`, contract v0.16). A code-free package that declares colors, icon replacements, and image layers for the backgrounds of screens, post tiles, FOWs and buttons. After installing, choose it in Settings → App appearance → Fonts and color scheme (applies in dark mode).",
