  "storeCatalogThemeRasqDescription": "Theme (`kind: \"theme\"`, contract v0.17). A gradient band along the top edge of post tiles fading from #1F1E33 into the post background color, a faint RASQ mark in the background, and a top-to-bottom #02775C → #178178 gradient for FOW backgrounds (with white text). Works in both light and dark mode.",
  "storeCatalogPaintName": "Doodle together",
  "storeCatalogPaintSummary": "Everyone gets one square to doodle in and shows it to others for a limited time. In ASTell rooms and on profiles.",
  "storeCatalogPaintDescription": "Custom plugin (slot `page`, contract v0.23). 3:4 squares are laid out in 2 columns (shuffled for each person); tap your own square to doodle in the media editor's SVG mode (saved compressed with zstd). Each person picks how long theirs is shown, and the admin (the session owner) sets the default and the maximum. Central deletes doodles when they expire. The admin can delete other people's doodles.",
